          "duration_sec": 706,
          "optional": true,
          "approx_size_mb": 47
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "",
            "الصيغة",
            "مثال"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "إثبات",
              "الفاعل + can + الفعل",
              "He can ride a bike."
            ],
            [
              "نفي",
              "الفاعل + can't + الفعل",
              "We can't swim."
            ],
            [
              "سؤال",
              "Can + الفاعل + الفعل؟",
              "Can you speak English?"
            ],
            [
              "إجابة",
              "Yes, I can. / No, I can't.",
              "Can she draw? — Yes, she can."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "**أخطاء شائعة:**\n\n- ✗ He cans swim. ← ✓ He **can** swim.\n- ✗ I can to swim. ← ✓ I can **swim**.\n- ✗ She can swims. ← ✓ She can **swim**.\n\n**للرد على الطلب:** Yes, of course. / Sure. / Sorry, I can't."
